From 17c5efc20be482236003136b959405c4496c93b6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Velox <velox@localhost>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 20:09:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] gfxstream: deferred vkResetDescriptorPool (host and guest
 negotiation)

Host: handle vkQueueCommitDescriptorSetUpdates2GOOGLE (codegen output
for the new command spliced into the checked-in decoder) and reset a
pool when the commit carries a newer reset epoch. Advertise
ANDROID_EMU_vulkan_deferred_descriptor_pool_reset with batched
descriptor updates when Vulkan snapshots are off (snapshots do not
record the epochs).

Guest: query the capability and pass it to the Vulkan driver.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: Ie0b1f199505845f50d2e0ebbecd74af764373f1e
